<SCENARIO VER="105">
<TXSPN>"Who burned the storehouse of the Niimura main house, that is."<PG>
"Just as Erina Goto and the others were closing in on Shigatsu Youka, the storehouse at the Niimura main house was burned and its precious books were lost."<PG>
"That mystery had not yet been solved, had it."<PG>
"Now, few scenarios remain, but let us go and see them. This is the last spurt."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\立木\春花用立ち絵\立木三日お辞儀.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "立木三日,立木ボード,プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{}
